This product bundles third-party data:

- Persian stop word list
  Source: stopwords-iso/stopwords-fa (https://github.com/stopwords-iso/stopwords-fa)
  License: MIT
  The list is normalized to canonical Persian letter forms and shipped at
  src/main/resources/ir/ac/sbu/parsi/data/stopwords.txt

- Persian lemma seed dictionary
  Curated by the ParsiAnalyzer contributors (Arabic broken plurals and
  suppletive comparatives). Licensed under Apache-2.0 with the project.

This product is built against Apache Lucene and Elasticsearch APIs (compile-time
only; not redistributed):

- Apache Lucene — Apache License 2.0
- Elasticsearch — provided by the target cluster
